<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <decisions>
        <name>Check_All_Required_Fields</name>
        <label>필수 조건 완비 여부 확인</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>287</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Set_NOT_READY</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>조건 미충족 — NOT_READY</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>All_Fields_Filled</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Product__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Quantity__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Delivery_Date__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.PLM_Revision__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Approval_Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>승인</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Set_READY</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>모든 필수 조건 충족 — READY</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Check_Already_Accepted</name>
        <label>이미 ACCEPTED 여부</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>167</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Check_All_Required_Fields</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>ACCEPTED 아님 — 조건 확인</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Accepted</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Handoff_Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>ACCEPTED</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <label>이미 ACCEPTED — 덮어쓰지 않음</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Technical Baseline 필수 조건 완비 시 Handoff_Status__c를 READY로 전환한다. ACCEPTED는 사람이 직접 설정하며 Flow가 덮어쓰지 않는다.</description>
    <interviewLabel>TB_D1_D2_Handoff {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>TB D1→D2 Handoff 게이트</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Set_NOT_READY</name>
        <label>NOT_READY로 설정</label>
        <locationX>302</locationX>
        <locationY>407</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Handoff_Status__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>NOT_READY</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputReference>$Record</inputReference>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Set_READY</name>
        <label>READY로 설정</label>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>407</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Handoff_Status__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>READY</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputReference>$Record</inputReference>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_Already_Accepted</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <object>Technical_Baseline__c</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Draft</status>
</Flow>
